Description: Generates artificial binary landscapes with defined spatial
    patterns and classifies landscapes by their pattern using neural
    networks. Two complementary approaches are provided: a pixel-based
    convolutional neural network that is trained on the raster directly
    (via the 'keras3' package), and a metrics-based classifier that first
    summarises each landscape with landscape metrics (via the
    'landscapemetrics' package) and uses these metrics to train a neural network (via the 'neuralnet' package). The package covers the
    full workflow from landscape generation and metric calculation through
    model training, cross-validation, and application to new landscapes,
    with plotting utilities for landscapes, metrics, and classification
    results.
